# 29.A.2 — Trivy allow-list. EMPTY by design: the HIGH/CRITICAL gate in
# .github/workflows/trivy.yml fails the build unless a finding is listed here.
#
# Every entry MUST follow this format (policy: SECURITY.md → "Allow-list
# policy"):
#
#   # CVE-YYYY-NNNNN — <why it is not exploitable here / what blocks the fix>
#   # owner: <github handle> — expires: <YYYY-MM-DD, max 90 days out>
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN
#
# An entry with no reason or no expiry gets removed in review. Expired entries
# are treated as new findings.
